<h1>Latin-English Dictionary</h1>
<p>From the English Wiktionary, Wiktionary data of {{ dump_date }}.</p>
<p>Look up a word by pressing and holding it in a book. A word that could be one of several entries (<i>latus</i>, <i>lātus</i>) shows each of them; swipe in the popup to see the next.</p>

